{
  "total": 131.968,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 14.223,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "When conversion tracking is wrong,",
          "start": 0.5,
          "end": 2.49,
          "gstart": 0.5,
          "gend": 2.49
        },
        {
          "text": "ad platforms can optimize toward the wrong actions,",
          "start": 2.89,
          "end": 6.257,
          "gstart": 2.89,
          "gend": 6.257
        },
        {
          "text": "or miss valuable leads and purchases.",
          "start": 6.657,
          "end": 9.281,
          "gstart": 6.657,
          "gend": 9.281
        },
        {
          "text": "The challenge is finding exactly where the data breaks.",
          "start": 9.681,
          "end": 13.223,
          "gstart": 9.681,
          "gend": 13.223
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "start": 14.223,
      "duration": 14.232,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I'm Shakil Ahmed Samim,",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 2.095,
          "gstart": 14.623,
          "gend": 16.318
        },
        {
          "text": "a Conversion Tracking and Web Analytics Specialist.",
          "start": 2.495,
          "end": 5.786,
          "gstart": 16.718,
          "gend": 20.009
        },
        {
          "text": "I help businesses diagnose tracking problems,",
          "start": 6.186,
          "end": 9.364,
          "gstart": 20.409,
          "gend": 23.587
        },
        {
          "text": "and build measurement systems they can test and maintain.",
          "start": 9.764,
          "end": 13.232,
          "gstart": 23.987,
          "gend": 27.455
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stack",
      "start": 28.455,
      "duration": 18.854,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I work with GA4, Google Tag Manager,",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 3.767,
          "gstart": 28.855,
          "gend": 32.221
        },
        {
          "text": "Google Ads conversion tracking, and Enhanced Conversions,",
          "start": 4.167,
          "end": 8.056,
          "gstart": 32.621,
          "gend": 36.511
        },
        {
          "text": "Meta Pixel and the Conversions API,",
          "start": 8.456,
          "end": 11.416,
          "gstart": 36.911,
          "gend": 39.871
        },
        {
          "text": "server-side tracking, ecommerce events,",
          "start": 11.816,
          "end": 14.451,
          "gstart": 40.271,
          "gend": 42.906
        },
        {
          "text": "and CRM integrations such as HubSpot.",
          "start": 14.851,
          "end": 17.854,
          "gstart": 43.306,
          "gend": 46.309
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "problems",
      "start": 47.309,
      "duration": 25.189,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Some problems need more than adding a tag.",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 3.118,
          "gstart": 47.709,
          "gend": 50.426
        },
        {
          "text": "A checkout boundary can complicate click ID capture.",
          "start": 3.518,
          "end": 7.309,
          "gstart": 50.826,
          "gend": 54.617
        },
        {
          "text": "A purchase event can fire more than once.",
          "start": 7.709,
          "end": 10.22,
          "gstart": 55.017,
          "gend": 57.529
        },
        {
          "text": "A server-side integration can send an event before an order qualifies.",
          "start": 10.62,
          "end": 15.594,
          "gstart": 57.929,
          "gend": 62.903
        },
        {
          "text": "And a lead form can lose important fields before they reach the CRM.",
          "start": 15.994,
          "end": 21.02,
          "gstart": 63.303,
          "gend": 68.328
        },
        {
          "text": "Each issue needs its own diagnosis.",
          "start": 21.42,
          "end": 24.089,
          "gstart": 68.728,
          "gend": 71.398
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "method",
      "start": 72.498,
      "duration": 23.743,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "My workflow is straightforward.",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 2.306,
          "gstart": 72.898,
          "gend": 74.804
        },
        {
          "text": "Audit the setup.",
          "start": 2.706,
          "end": 3.8,
          "gstart": 75.204,
          "gend": 76.297
        },
        {
          "text": "Trace the event, from the user action, through the data layer and tags.",
          "start": 4.2,
          "end": 8.622,
          "gstart": 76.697,
          "gend": 81.119
        },
        {
          "text": "Implement the fix,",
          "start": 9.022,
          "end": 10.324,
          "gstart": 81.519,
          "gend": 82.821
        },
        {
          "text": "and test the full journey.",
          "start": 10.724,
          "end": 12.276,
          "gstart": 83.221,
          "gend": 84.774
        },
        {
          "text": "I check event parameters, identifiers, consent behavior, and deduplication,",
          "start": 12.676,
          "end": 18.257,
          "gstart": 85.174,
          "gend": 90.755
        },
        {
          "text": "and the receiving platform, wherever the available tools allow.",
          "start": 18.657,
          "end": 22.743,
          "gstart": 91.155,
          "gend": 95.241
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "evidence",
      "start": 96.241,
      "duration": 18.576,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I focus on evidence, not just whether a tag fired.",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 4.274,
          "gstart": 96.641,
          "gend": 100.514
        },
        {
          "text": "The goal is to confirm that the correct event,",
          "start": 4.674,
          "end": 7.297,
          "gstart": 100.914,
          "gend": 103.537
        },
        {
          "text": "with the right values and rules,",
          "start": 7.697,
          "end": 9.571,
          "gstart": 103.937,
          "gend": 105.812
        },
        {
          "text": "reaches the intended destination.",
          "start": 9.971,
          "end": 12.287,
          "gstart": 106.212,
          "gend": 108.528
        },
        {
          "text": "I also document limitations, and anything that still needs review.",
          "start": 12.687,
          "end": 17.576,
          "gstart": 108.928,
          "gend": 113.817
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cta",
      "start": 114.817,
      "duration": 17.151,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "If your tracking is unreliable, or your conversions don't reconcile,",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 5.234,
          "gstart": 115.217,
          "gend": 120.05
        },
        {
          "text": "or your website and CRM aren't sharing the right data,",
          "start": 5.634,
          "end": 9.384,
          "gstart": 120.45,
          "gend": 124.201
        },
        {
          "text": "let's review the setup, and find the next fix.",
          "start": 9.784,
          "end": 12.651,
          "gstart": 124.601,
          "gend": 127.468
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}